  "ruleText": "CHAPTER Odb 200 OIL FUND DISBURSEMENT BOARD PROCEDURES\n\nREVISION NOTE\n\nDocument #5534, effective 12-21-92, made extensive changes to the wording, structure, and numbering of rules in Chapter Odb 200. Document #5534 supersedes all prior filings for the sections in this chapter. The prior filings for former Chapter Odb 200 include the following documents:\n\n#4760, eff 2-13-90\n\n#5115, eff 4-16-91\n\nStatutory Authority: RSA 146-D:5, I, RSA 146-E:6, I , RSA 146-F:5, I, RSA 146-G:11 and RSA 541-A:16, I(b)",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/odb100-600.html"
